a land information memorandum Lim report  is a summary of the relevant and most  important information that local council  holds on a property whether you're  buying or selling a property it's  essential that you're well-informed  about the legal and natural  characteristics of the building and land  your local council is required by law to  issue you a limb within ten days of  request we also offer a fast-track  option for those last-minute decisions  getting a limb report out to you sooner  if needed your limb will describe the  risk of natural hazards to the building  or land such as whether there has been  flooding or a slip if you're in a  tsunami zone and the nearest evacuation  routes the likely strength of shaking in  an earthquake or the degree of  liquefaction that's likely to occur in  the event of an earthquake your limb  will also alert you to hazards of the  land like whether or not it's  contaminated by hazardous substances or  contains  uncertified or uncompacted fill a limb  report will tell you if there are listed  significant natural cultural and  archaeological sites on the land these  might include protected areas of bush or  trees a heritage building or an old par  site alone we provide a record of all  consented building work this is helpful  in identifying potentially illegal and  unsafe building work that may cause  problems in the future  it will also give you information the  council holds on services such as the  location of water supply storm water and  sewage systems a limb can also warn you  if the building is on the leaky  buildings register or if the council is  aware of any bit amphetamine  contamination issues identifying these  issues early on may save you lots of  money and angst in the long term  Limor reports can offer lots of other  useful information such as the valuation  of the building and land payable rates  and rates owing and community services  such as the local rubbish day as a  potential buyer a Lim will help you  identify potential problems early on and  decide whether the property is worth  purchasing as a vendor streamline the  process with one less condition on sale  and say hey there's nothing to hide here  the knowledge you gain from a Lim report  means that you're minimizing your  exposure to risk buying with confidence  and ultimately giving yourself peace of  mind  [Music]
 

